# Copy to .env (or .env.local) and fill in. Never commit real values.
#
# GitHub fine-grained token, "Public repositories (read-only)", no extra permissions.
# Read at build time only (server side) to fetch the contribution heatmap.
# Do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_. If unset, the Activity section falls back
# to a plain link to the GitHub profile.
# On Cloudflare Pages, add it under Settings > Variables and Secrets (Secret).
GH_API_TOKEN=
